  "solution": "Given : 57 * 35 * 7 * 14 * 2 * 43\n\nIn this type of questions, we check the options and solve the equation\n\nOption 1: ×, +, ÷, -, =\n\n57 × 35 + **7 ÷ 14** - 2\n\n= **57 × 35** + 0.5 - 2\n\n= **1995 + 0.5 **- 2\n\n=1995.5 - 2\n\n=1993.5, not equal to 43\n\nOption 2. +, -, ×, ÷, =\n\n= 57 + 35 - 7 × **14 ÷ 2 **= 43\n\n= 57 + 35 - **7 × 7 **= 43\n\n= **57 + 35** - 49 = 43\n\n= **92 - 49 **= 43\n\n= 43 = 43\n\nOption 3. +, ÷, -, ×, =\n\n57 + **35 ÷ 7** - 14 × 2 = 43\n\n= 57 + 5 - **14 × 2 **= 43,\n\n= **57 + 5** - 7 = 43\n\n= **62 - 7** = 43\n\n= 55 not equal to 43\n\nOption 4. -, ÷, +, ×, =\n\n57 - **35 ÷ 7** + 14 × 2 = 43\n\n= 57 - 5 + **14 × 2** = 43,\n\n= **57 **- 5 + **7** \n\n= **64 - 5**\n\n= 59 not equal to 43\n\nTherefore, only option(2) is equating the equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"****+, -, ×, ÷, =\"**",
